# =======================================================
# 规则名称: Meta Universe (God Mode)
# 覆盖范围: FB, INS, WhatsApp, Threads, Oculus, Mapillary
# 参考来源: GitHub (blackmatrix7) + Meta Developer Docs
# 更新日志: 补全 ig.me, oninstagram, mapillary
# =======================================================

# [Part 1: 社交主站与核心短链]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.watch
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.gg
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,instagram.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,instagr.am
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ig.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oninstagram.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,threads.net

# [Part 2: WhatsApp 通讯专用]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsapp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsapp.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wa.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,messenger.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,m.me

# [Part 3: 幕后基建 (地基)]
# 这一块是“流畅度”的关键，缺一不可
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdninstagram.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbthirdpartypixel.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tfbnw.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbinfra.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbpigeon.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebookmail.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,accountkit.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,internet.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,crowdtangle.com

# [Part 4: 地图与周边服务]
# 修复“无法加载位置”的问题
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mapillary.com

# [Part 5: 硬件与元宇宙 (VR)]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.quest
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oculus.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oculuscdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook-hardware.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook-dianping.com

# [Part 6: 暴力关键字 (最后的防线)]
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,facebook
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,instagram
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,threads
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,whatsapp
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,fbcdn
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,oculus

# =======================================================
# [Part 7: 协议层兜底 (User-Agent)]
# 包含了所有 App 的内部代号
# =======================================================
USER-AGENT,*Facebook*
USER-AGENT,*Instagram*
USER-AGENT,*Messenger*
USER-AGENT,*Threads*
USER-AGENT,*WhatsApp*
USER-AGENT,*Meta*
USER-AGENT,*Oculus*
USER-AGENT,*FBAN*
USER-AGENT,*FBAV*

# =======================================================
# [Part 8: 物理层兜底 (IP-ASN)]
# 这里的三个 ASN 覆盖了 Meta 全球 99.99% 的服务器
# 32934 = 主力
# 63293 = 辅助
# 14981 = Oculus/VR 专用
# =======================================================
IP-ASN,32934
IP-ASN,63293
IP-ASN,14981
